<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - JP Foodservice started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - JP Foodservice started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst John Renwick said on Monday he had started coverage of JP Foodservice Inc with a rating of outperform.</p>
<p>-- &quot;It's just got earnings momentum and industry consolidation,&quot; he told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- The Columbia, Md., food distributor's shares opened on Monday up 3/8 to 26-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
